  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Production and Processing of Certified Rice Seed</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to contribute towards enhancement of food security by increasing production and productivity of rice, the key staple crop in Cote d&#x2019;Ivoire. This will be achieved by increasing the national production capacity for certified rice seeds and gradually expanding rice production areas.</narrative>
